our guitar playing habits. If you’re playing every day for an hour or two then you might want to change the strings as often as once every other week. If you’re a performing artist then don’t ever go on stage without a new set of strings.f you don’t play that often your strings might die of old age. In this case I advise to change them every other month or every three months. Again, if you’re planning on impressing your girlfriend with a nice tune it’ll be nice to have a new set of strings for that too.

